</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><span style="font-weight:bold">Proposal 2.</span> The amendment to the Amended and Restated Certificate of Incorporation to effect a reverse stock split of the issued shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, par value $0.01 per share (the &#8220;Common Stock&#8221;), at a ratio ranging from 1 <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">share-for-5</span></span> shares up to a ratio of 1 <span style="white-space:nowrap"><span style="white-space:nowrap">share-for-20</span></span> shares, with the exact ratio, if any, to be selected by the board of directors (the &#8220;Board&#8221;) and set forth in a public announcement, has been approved. </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
